            </note>
            <note corresp="#d114-f2" n="95" xml:id="d114-f2-content">
                <p>For text of Sir Samuel Hoare’s speech at the 16th Assembly of the League on
                    September 11, 1935, see League of Nations, <hi rendition="#italic">Official
